<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuadorian fishermen are suing the Trump administration for unlawful drone attacks that sank their boat, alleging kidnapping and torture. Prison gangs continue expanding drug trafficking, exemplified by a man sentenced for fentanyl and heroin offenses, while President Noboa denies any U.S. military base in the country. Violence against civilians persists, with a journalist murdered outside his home, two local election candidates shot dead in El Oro, and a priest killed when a crucifix fell during mass. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNZ3g4ODh6X3JMRUl6OE9MNzNFclBLM09acm5ZbmJsdDRlMmRMS0RzVDJBRFhxT3ZhR09TcEJ5WmVKTWdqM3F1bko4UnloVHpIR09Ja2NyX1h3TWM2emZtSDlUWEE1UnNaR01ZT0FaZ05hcHpiQ0hpUk5VWWtKVVlzYjNmY0tVamJld3QzUjNHQTA0ZDg5MXd3VFJKN0szNUpKaU9JRlVZY1NPcnRUdXZUeE1GbVN3THZOV0cyMVg0VQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPellnSEs3dmktLXQ0NzZGM3NpZHFtRFpWcWJUdUxUNHROd0lpSUdwcEpiME5CV2VjaDhSQVpQc0RycEpxQlYwS2I1dnJkaXdPTmtJSFEzcDFhTFJnTEZ0ejNKZjVNdTdTLUdyYk54VlB4T2xPeGU0Tk55WTlqS0REM1JjWFdlMDlOV0kyY1VUZldZUmpKclFPdTBzQUVCV0FySlJBNUNBSkZaQ1dpTXpzblNEWDlNdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg Law News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQZFFLRXdkUk9WMWJDc3RYTVhnYlZ2bEhVTGRqazJ6OEE5YVFFemtWa2dVdDU2ZG9ycGJkRkVzV1FrSDVaLVlJN1JSNmZpU1E0R29rc0lEbU1mRnVCMzN2aFE2RGNhUFU2cGM2Sm5Rc1liQ0pkNjVhQ1BoeEVBdUxRdzZpU005TDJpRS1GdUVlX2Z3bmZldG1WS2txOGhUMmFHeU5WRVhWclk5RnNyLTFJZUp2M0tOb1d2cTJYd3h6YmU3dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPUkF6QTdlZlB3NDJJbVZ4VnVLSUdhcFF4WjRSOFpoWkhMcnc3RVZ